Rune rings: absolute centered at 50% 50%, width min(90vmin,900px), border 1px, conic gradient mask? Use border with dashed and rotate animation; low opacity. Ring-2 smaller. Add pseudo glyphs? Keep.

#stars i absolute small circles with twinkle animation.

